#: ../../modules/index.md:25
msgid "Runtime"
msgstr "运行时模块（Runtime）"

#: ../../modules/index.md:57
msgid "Development"
msgstr "开发模块（Development）"

#: ../../modules/index.md:65
msgid "Prefabs"
msgstr "预制件（Prefabs）"

#: ../../modules/index.md:5 cd2fa1ba0335441482d914ee25e13ab3
msgid "🧩 Modules"
msgstr "🧩 模块"

#: ../../modules/index.md:7 84338a0d88a2413b8b6b89c77f3f8449
msgid ""
"Bookshelf is designed with modularity in mind. Features that serve a "
"common purpose are organized into distinct, standalone, namespaced "
"modules."
msgstr "Bookshelf 采用模块化设计理念，将实现相近功能的特性归入独立的命名空间模块。"

#: ../../modules/index.md:11 1f8ee3ed60384353a43519ebb4175c71
msgid "🌟 Featured Modules"
msgstr "🌟 精选模块"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:5 2547c4dbd90c41aabcd392e6b82ad138
msgid "🧱 Block"
msgstr "🧱 方块"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:10 c9973805e4214190bb88517673da9567
msgid "Get and manipulate blocks (supports block states and NBTs)."
msgstr "获取并操作方块（支持方块状态和NBT标签）。"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:13 5d2a77d4c12f464595886b2eda1ceca9
msgid "🔦 Raycast"
msgstr "🔦 光线投射"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:18 1d1b98e81e1d4b5b9e534fd52e476558
msgid "Cast rays and see if they collide with blocks or entities."
msgstr "投射光线并检测它们是否与方块或实体发生碰撞。"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:21 3c21776c0b3e48539a754f33dc293338
msgid "🧮 Math"
msgstr "🧮 数学"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:26 b5a98e350261441d8684396990ac8da8
msgid "Mathematical functions: sin, cos, exp, log, sqrt, and much more!"
msgstr "数学函数：三角函数、指数、对数、开方等等！"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:29 9cde7ac6dd7a487da5601bb2da2a2145
msgid "🏗️ Generation"
msgstr "🏗️ 生成"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:34 7d82e816f0fd444f98149e1516df098f
msgid "Iterate efficiently over the world to generate terrains and landscapes."
msgstr "高效遍历世界以生成地形和景观。"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:37 91e4da4903d64e10925a3f82c102271a
msgid "🎲 Random"
msgstr "🎲 随机"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:42 961f61aa25ea441cade370600774a523
msgid "Random functions for different distributions and noise patterns."
msgstr "用于不同分布和噪声模式的随机函数。"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:45 8927edeecb0947b4a98145e25569119e
msgid "❤️ Health"
msgstr "❤️ 生命"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:50 e23f1683899048fa83c8bb5160a8300d
msgid "Easily manage the health of a player or the lifetime of an entity!"
msgstr "轻松管理玩家的生命值或实体的生命周期！"

#: ../../modules/index.md:18 ede623fb67e848f6b6be7e80d0591595
msgid "📖 Key Definitions"
msgstr "📖 关键概念"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:2 1823b03306d2483abae802c637a45841
msgid "General concepts"
msgstr "通用概念"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:3 47eb78516348461b8d4a80fbd94c56cc
msgid "**Bundle**"
msgstr "**捆绑包**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:4 1700955e6e1b493c8640ab0de8624993
msgid "A set of modules packaged together for distribution."
msgstr "一组打包在一起用于分发的模块。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:5 2186df2b3cf54a08a86f8cf2c4921b4f
msgid "**Dependency**"
msgstr "**依赖项**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:6 1d18ef24fa7744349cbdfc53f2a62184
msgid ""
"A module that another module relies on to function properly. It must be "
"loaded for the dependent module to work."
msgstr "其他模块正常运行所依赖的模块。依赖项必须被加载才能让依赖它的模块正常工作。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:7 4a773db48c5745aeb136f71c077e78bf
msgid "**Feature**"
msgstr "**特性**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:8 3442c9338f94428dae3ec14e0bb65498
msgid ""
"A user-facing element designed to accomplish a task. Features are often "
"represented as function tags, but can also include predicates, number "
"providers, loot tables, tags, and more."
msgstr "一个面向用户的、用于完成特定任务的元素。特性通常表现为函数标签，但也可以包括谓词、数值提供器、战利品表、标签等。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:9 f37cbb3426a649c09ccde9b1c482fdbe
msgid "**Module**"
msgstr "**模块**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:10 0067fb1fe70e4660ae6f0f7f967b6b5c
msgid ""
"A collection of related features within a namespace, serving a specific "
"purpose."
msgstr "在同一命名空间内服务于特定目的的相关特性的集合。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:11 c3e437fb4a494bec9e43e2de58ee24b1
msgid "**Weak Dependency**"
msgstr "**弱依赖项**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:12 222e45e5805c4b9d89ccf313593b941d
msgid ""
"An optional dependency that enhances functionality if present, but is not"
" essential for the main module to function correctly."
msgstr "可选的依赖项，存在时可以增强功能，但对主模块的正常运行不是必需的。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:15 8d9cd8be270b453db567c604fffb50fd
msgid "Special arguments"
msgstr "特殊参数"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:16 7072ac5716d142a1bf9c0d4ef5af3abe
msgid "**`run`**"
msgstr "**`run`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:17 50a4e2bb905d47c18082b503effaae3d
msgid "Specifies a command to be executed by a feature."
msgstr "指定由特性执行的命令。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:18 22e9d221d5e44284990b325dcc5aa7ef
msgid "**`with`**"
msgstr "**`with`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:19 e1178962214649f5b87f575e739df763
msgid "Groups the optional arguments of a feature called with a macro."
msgstr "将通过宏调用的特性的可选参数归为一组。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:22 8b27ccef5d784065af295fd44e0c6ba1
msgid "Special functions"
msgstr "特殊函数"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:23 8cd9d54717294d2ba76f076fab72cf83
msgid "**`*.in`**"
msgstr "**`*.in`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:24 474bef3fe26447198b4ee275a0d9da65
msgid ""
"The function tag that takes the inputs of a feature as macro arguments, "
"instead of reading them from its storage."
msgstr "以宏参数的形式接收特性输入的函数标签，而不是从其存储中读取输入。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:25 e70b86c31a8749d8a6a3f6c5374098f4
msgid "**`*_ata`**"
msgstr "**`*_ata`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:26 4039cdd2e4af4709870fea910aa8ef05
msgid ""
"Shortened from \"as to at.\" These functions take two positions: one "
"given through a positional argument (e.g., `positioned`, `at`), and the "
"other from the executor's position."
msgstr "缩写自“as to at”。这些函数接受两个位置：一个通过位置参数给出（如 `positioned`、`at`），另一个来自执行者的位置。"

